WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.328 --> 00:00:17.195
angry ox lowered its head and snorted.

2
00:00:17.215 --> 00:00:19.517
"Let's run!"

3
00:00:20.097 --> 00:00:20.978
shouted Mandy.

4
00:00:22.479 --> 00:00:24.581
"Where?" Vinnie cried.

5
00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:26.982
"What's going on?"

6
00:00:27.703 --> 00:00:29.044
a voice said suddenly.

7
00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:32.862
A young boy about Mandy's age appeared.

8
00:00:33.983 --> 00:00:37.907
He spoke softly to the angry ox and patted its neck.

9
00:00:37.927 --> 00:00:42.611
"Well, we stuttered Vinnie.

10
00:00:42.631 --> 00:00:45.153
"Did you come to see Budi?

11
00:00:46.053 --> 00:00:48.055
The fastest ox in the village?"

12
00:00:49.256 --> 00:00:50.757
the boy asked proudly.

13
00:00:51.878 --> 00:00:54.701
He tied a ribbon around the calm ox's head.

14
00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.983
"What's your name?"

15
00:00:57.663 --> 00:00:58.384
asked Mandy.

16
00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:05.844
"I'm Wayan, and these are my oxen, Budi and Gede," he replied.

17
00:01:05.864 --> 00:01:07.806
"Who are you?"

18
00:01:09.227 --> 00:01:11.388
The children introduced themselves.

19
00:01:12.709 --> 00:01:14.750
Wayan had black hair and eyes.

20
00:01:15.871 --> 00:01:19.093
He wore a long, layered skirt but no shirt.

21
00:01:19.113 --> 00:01:21.595
"Are you here for the races?"

22
00:01:22.896 --> 00:01:26.438
Wayan asked, tying a ribbon on the other ox.

23
00:01:27.779 --> 00:01:29.645
"Races?" asked Vinnie.

24
00:01:30.886 --> 00:01:32.968
Just then a girl walked up.

25
00:01:34.329 --> 00:01:36.791
She stopped when she saw Vinnie and Mandy.

26
00:01:36.811 --> 00:01:40.074
"Wayan!" she exclaimed.

27
00:01:40.094 --> 00:01:42.576
"Here are some flowers."

28
00:01:43.957 --> 00:01:46.980
Mandy introduced herself and Vinnie to the girl.

29
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:52.084
"I am Wayan's younger sister, Nyoman," she said.

30
00:01:52.104 --> 00:01:55.107
"Why are you decorating the oxen?"

31
00:01:55.727 --> 00:01:56.388
asked Vinnie.

32
00:01:57.436 --> 00:02:01.278
The two animals were now decorated with ribbons and flowers.

33
00:02:01.298 --> 00:02:06.841
"So people know who owns them," explained Nyoman.

34
00:02:06.861 --> 00:02:09.683
"And it makes them look handsome."

35
00:02:09.703 --> 00:02:12.504
"What kind of race is it?"

36
00:02:13.085 --> 00:02:13.825
asked Mandy.

37
00:02:13.845 --> 00:02:19.048
"It's a race of the fastest oxen," Nyoman said.

38
00:02:19.068 --> 00:02:21.269
"It is a tradition.

39
00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:26.132
Long ago, farmers needed to plant the rice seed quickly.

40
00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.502
They needed to plant several crops a year.

41
00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:33.806
So they made their oxen plow faster and faster.

42
00:02:34.987 --> 00:02:36.808
Soon it became a contest."

43
00:02:38.009 --> 00:02:40.731
Nyoman and Wayan's parents walked up.

44
00:02:40.751 --> 00:02:43.294
"Are these your friends?"

45
00:02:44.655 --> 00:02:47.037
their father asked, smiling kindly.

46
00:02:47.057 --> 00:02:50.720
"Yes. Can they come to the race with us?"

47
00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:52.341
asked Wayan.

48
00:02:52.361 --> 00:02:57.441
"Of course, but we must hurry," replied his father.

49
00:02:57.461 --> 00:03:02.025
Wayan and his father led the oxen down the road.

50
00:03:03.246 --> 00:03:07.169
Vinnie and Mandy followed with Nyoman and her mother.

51
00:03:07.189 --> 00:03:10.972
"Wow! What is that?"

52
00:03:12.233 --> 00:03:16.757
Mandy pointed to a hill that looked like a tall, grassy staircase.

53
00:03:16.777 --> 00:03:21.020
"Those are rice fields," explained Nyoman.

54
00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:24.143
"They look like giant steps!"

55
00:03:24.823 --> 00:03:25.544
Vinnie said.

56
00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:30.401
"The farmers specially shape the land like that," said Nyoman.

57
00:03:30.421 --> 00:03:33.262
"Why?" asked Vinnie.

58
00:03:33.282 --> 00:03:38.003
"It helps them send water evenly to all the fields.

59
00:03:39.024 --> 00:03:41.384
Water is very important to rice fields.

60
00:03:42.565 --> 00:03:48.346
The rice farmers must work together to keep all these fields alive," explained Nyoman.

61
00:03:49.747 --> 00:03:53.088
The children saw narrow streams of water here and there.

62
00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:56.403
Nyoman shook her head at them.

63
00:03:56.423 --> 00:04:01.990
"How can you live in Bali and not know about rice fields or the races?"

64
00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:05.113
"Bali?" cried Mandy.

65
00:04:06.255 --> 00:04:07.316
She turned to Vinnie.

66
00:04:07.336 --> 00:04:10.259
"We're in Indonesia!"
